# Multi-Zones reverse proxy: serve the separate Next.js "learning" app under
# microdegree.work/learning/*. MUST sit above the SPA catch-all below, since
# _redirects rules are first-match top-to-bottom. 200! = forced proxy: Netlify
# returns the upstream response with the URL staying on www.microdegree.work
# (never a 301/302). The /* splat also carries /learning/_next/*,
# /learning/images/* and /learning/api/*. Origin is also mirrored in
# netlify.toml; LEARNING_ORIGIN in .env.example / Netlify config documents it.
